Q: Conforming an array to Identifiable in SwiftUI A: <p>First of all, wrap your <code>Array</code> into a container:</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>struct ArrayWrapper {
    let items: [ItemType]
}
</code></pre>
<p>Then if <code>ItemType</code> is <code>Identifiable</code>, you can add this conformance to <code>Identifiable</code> for <code>ArrayWrapper</code>:</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>extension ArrayWrapper: Identifiable {
    var id: [String] {
        items.map(\.id)
    }
}
</code></pre>
